<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>VEX — Enforce AI Trades. Prove Every Action.</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script type="module" src="https://unpkg.com/@splinetool/viewer@1.12.98/build/spline-viewer.js"></script>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#04050a;
    --ink:#EAEEF6;
    --muted:#8A93A6;
    --muted-2:#5C6478;
    --panel:rgba(10,13,22,0.52);
    --panel-solid:#0A0D16;
    --border:rgba(234,238,246,0.10);
    --border-strong:rgba(234,238,246,0.18);
    --amber:#FF8A3D;
    --amber-dim:rgba(255,138,61,0.14);
    --cyan:#57E0E8;
    --green:#6EE7A0;
    --red:#FF5C5C;
    --radius:2px;
    --font-display:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    --font-body:'Inter', sans-serif;
    --font-mono:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:var(--font-body);
    line-height:1.5;
    overflow-x:hidden;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }

  /* ===== SPLINE BACKGROUND ===== */
  #spline-bg{
    position:fixed;
    inset:0;
    width:100vw;
    height:100vh;
    z-index:-2;
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  spline-viewer{
    width:100%;
    height:100%;
    display:block;
  }
  #bg-veil{
    position:fixed;
    inset:0;
    z-index:-1;
    pointer-events:none;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 40% at 50% 0%, rgba(4,5,10,0.15), rgba(4,5,10,0.75) 55%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(4,5,10,0.35) 0%, rgba(4,5,10,0.15) 20%, rgba(4,5,10,0.55) 70%, var(--bg) 100%);
  }
  #grid-overlay{
    position:fixed;
    inset:0;
    z-index:-1;
    pointer-events:none;
    opacity:0.35;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(234,238,246,0.035) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(234,238,246,0.035) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size:64px 64px;
    mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 20%, black, transparent 75%);
  }

  ::selection{background:var(--amber);color:#1a1000;}

  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}
  .mono{font-family:var(--font-mono);}

  .wrap{
    max-width:1180px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:0 32px;
  }

  /* ===== NAV ===== */
  header{
    position:fixed;
    top:0;left:0;right:0;
    z-index:100;
    background:rgba(4,5,10,0.55);
    backdrop-filter:blur(14px) saturate(140%);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px) saturate(140%);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
  }
  nav{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    padding:16px 32px;
    max-width:1180px;
    margin:0 auto;
  }
  .brand{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
    font-family:var(--font-display);
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:19px;
    letter-spacing:0.02em;
  }
  .brand-dot{
    width:8px;height:8px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--amber);
    box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--amber), 0 0 16px rgba(255,138,61,0.5);
    animation:pulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes pulse{
    0%,100%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1);}
    50%{opacity:0.5;transform:scale(0.8);}
  }
  .nav-links{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:28px;
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:12.5px;
    letter-spacing:0.04em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--muted);
  }
  .nav-links a{transition:color 0.2s;}
  .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--ink);}
  .nav-cta{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:12px;
  }
  @media(max-width:860px){ .nav-links{display:none;} }

  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    padding:11px 20px;
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:12.5px;
    font-weight:500;
    letter-spacing:0.03em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    border:1px solid var(--border-strong);
    transition:all 0.2s ease;
    white-space:nowrap;
    cursor:pointer;
  }
  .btn-primary{
    background:var(--amber);
    color:#1a0f05;
    border-color:var(--amber);
    font-weight:600;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover{
    background:#ffa563;
    box-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(255,138,61,0.35);
  }
  .btn-ghost{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  .btn-ghost:hover{
    border-color:var(--border-strong);
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  }
  .btn-sm{padding:8px 14px;font-size:11.5px;}

  /* ===== HERO ===== */
  .hero{
    min-height:100vh;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    text-align:center;
    padding:140px 32px 80px;
    position:relative;
  }
  .hud-corner{
    position:absolute;
    width:28px;height:28px;
    border:1px solid var(--border-strong);
    opacity:0.6;
  }
  .hud-corner.tl{top:100px;left:32px;border-right:none;border-bottom:none;}
  .hud-corner.tr{top:100px;right:32px;border-left:none;border-bottom:none;}
  .hud-corner.bl{bottom:40px;left:32px;border-right:none;border-top:none;}
  .hud-corner.br{bottom:40px;right:32px;border-left:none;border-top:none;}
  @media(max-width:768px){ .hud-corner{display:none;} }

  .eyebrow{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:9px;
    padding:7px 14px;
    border:1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius:100px;
    background:var(--panel);
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:11.5px;
    letter-spacing:0.08em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--muted);
    margin-bottom:32px;
  }
  .eyebrow .live-dot{
    width:6px;height:6px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--green);
    box-shadow:0 0 6px var(--green);
    animation:pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-family:var(--font-display);
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:clamp(38px, 6.5vw, 78px);
    line-height:1.04;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    max-width:920px;
    margin-bottom:26px;
  }
  .hero h1 .accent{color:var(--amber);}
  .hero-sub{
    font-size:17.5px;
    color:var(--muted);
    max-width:600px;
    line-height:1.65;
    margin-bottom:40px;
  }
  .hero-actions{
    display:flex;
    gap:14px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    justify-content:center;
    margin-bottom:36px;
  }
  .hero-meta{
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--muted-2);
    display:flex;
    gap:10px;
    align-items:center;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    justify-content:center;
    letter-spacing:0.02em;
  }
  .hero-meta span.sep{opacity:0.4;}
  .hero-meta a{color:var(--muted);border-bottom:1px dotted var(--border-strong);}
  .hero-meta a:hover{color:var(--ink);}

  /* ===== ticker ===== */
  .ticker{
    margin-top:56px;
    width:100%;
    max-width:640px;
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    background:var(--panel);
    backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:14px 20px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:12.5px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:10px;
  }
  .ticker-item{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;align-items:flex-start;}
  .ticker-item .label{color:var(--muted-2);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;}
  .ticker-item .value{color:var(--cyan);}

  /* ===== SECTION GENERIC ===== */
  section{
    position:relative;
    padding:120px 0;
  }
  .section-head{
    max-width:680px;
    margin-bottom:64px;
  }
  .section-eyebrow{
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:12px;
    letter-spacing:0.12em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--amber);
    margin-bottom:16px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
  }
  .section-eyebrow::before{
    content:'';
    width:22px;height:1px;
    background:var(--amber);
  }
  .section-head h2{
    font-family:var(--font-display);
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:clamp(28px,3.6vw,42px);
    line-height:1.15;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    margin-bottom:18px;
  }
  .section-head p{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:16px;
    line-height:1.7;
  }

  .panel{
    background:var(--panel);
    backdrop-filter:blur(16px) saturate(140%);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(16px) saturate(140%);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
  }

  .reveal{
    opacity:0;
    transform:translateY(24px);
    transition:opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;
  }
  .reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}

  /* ===== ARTICLES (What VEX is) ===== */
  .articles{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:1px;
    background:var(--border);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  @media(max-width:860px){ .articles{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .article-card{
    background:var(--panel-solid);
    padding:36px 32px;
    position:relative;
  }
  .article-num{
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:11.5px;
    letter-spacing:0.1em;
    color:var(--muted-2);
    text-transform:uppercase;
    margin-bottom:24px;
  }
  .article-glyph{
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--amber);
    margin-bottom:10px;
    letter-spacing:0.06em;
  }
  .article-card h3{
    font-family:var(--font-display);
    font-size:23px;
    font-weight:600;
    line-height:1.3;
    margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .article-card h3 em{color:var(--amber);font-style:normal;}
  .article-card p{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:14.5px;
    line-height:1.7;
  }

  /* ===== MODES GRID ===== */
  .modes-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:1px;
    background:var(--border);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
  }
  @media(max-width:700px){ .modes-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .mode-card{
    background:var(--panel-solid);
    padding:32px;
  }
  .mode-tags{
    display:flex;
    gap:8px;
    margin-bottom:18px;
  }
  .tag{
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:10.5px;
    letter-spacing:0.06em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    padding:4px 9px;
    border-radius:100px;
    border:1px solid var(--border-strong);
    color:var(--muted);
  }
  .tag.on{
    border-color:rgba(110,231,160,0.4);
    color:var(--green);
    background:rgba(110,231,160,0.06);
  }
  .tag.off{
    border-color:rgba(255,92,92,0.35);
    color:var(--red);
    background:rgba(255,92,92,0.06);
  }
  .mode-card h4{
    font-family:var(--font-display);
    font-size:19px;
    font-weight:600;
    margin-bottom:10px;
  }
  .mode-card p{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:14px;
    line-height:1.65;
  }

  /* ===== MEMORY ===== */
  .memory-wrap{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:56px;
    align-items:center;
  }
  @media(max-width:860px){ .memory-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px;} }
  .memory-tiers{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;}
  .tier{
    padding:18px 22px;
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    background:var(--panel);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    gap:12px;
  }
  .tier .t-name{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:600;font-size:15.5px;}
  .tier .t-desc{color:var(--muted);font-size:12.5px;margin-top:3px;}
  .tier .t-decay{
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:11px;
    color:var(--cyan);
    text-align:right;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .memory-note{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:14.5px;
    line-height:1.75;
  }
  .memory-note strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:500;}

  /* ===== DOWNLOAD ===== */
  .download-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
    gap:1px;
    background:var(--border);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
  }
  @media(max-width:900px){ .download-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;} }
  @media(max-width:520px){ .download-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .os-card{
    background:var(--panel-solid);
    padding:28px 24px;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:16px;
    justify-content:space-between;
    min-height:150px;
  }
  .os-card.soon{opacity:0.5;}
  .os-name{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:600;font-size:16.5px;}
  .os-file{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted-2);}
  .os-dl{
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--amber);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:6px;
  }

  /* ===== TOKEN ===== */
  .token-panel{
    padding:44px;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:28px;
  }
  @media(max-width:640px){ .token-panel{padding:26px;} }
  .token-top{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:flex-start;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:20px;
  }
  .token-stats{
    display:flex;
    gap:36px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .token-stats .stat .label{
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:10.5px;
    letter-spacing:0.06em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--muted-2);
    margin-bottom:6px;
  }
  .token-stats .stat .value{
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:20px;
    color:var(--cyan);
  }
  .contract-row{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:12px;
    padding:14px 18px;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .contract-row .label{
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:11px;
    color:var(--muted-2);
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:0.06em;
  }
  .contract-row code{
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:13px;
    color:var(--ink);
    flex:1;
    min-width:180px;
  }
  .copy-btn{
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:11px;
    color:var(--amber);
    border:1px solid var(--border-strong);
    padding:6px 12px;
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    cursor:pointer;
    background:transparent;
    transition:all 0.2s;
  }
  .copy-btn:hover{background:var(--amber-dim);}
  .token-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .token-disclaimer{
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:11.5px;
    color:var(--muted-2);
    line-height:1.7;
    border-top:1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top:20px;
  }

  /* ===== FAQ ===== */
  .faq-item{
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
    padding:26px 0;
    cursor:pointer;
  }
  .faq-item:first-child{border-top:1px solid var(--border);}
  .faq-q{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    gap:20px;
  }
  .faq-q .qnum{
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--amber);
    margin-right:14px;
  }
  .faq-q h4{
    font-family:var(--font-display);
    font-size:17px;
    font-weight:500;
    flex:1;
  }
  .faq-toggle{
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:18px;
    color:var(--muted);
    transition:transform 0.25s;
    flex-shrink:0;
  }
  .faq-item.open .faq-toggle{transform:rotate(45deg);color:var(--amber);}
  .faq-a{
    max-height:0;
    overflow:hidden;
    transition:max-height 0.35s ease, margin-top 0.35s ease;
  }
  .faq-item.open .faq-a{max-height:200px;margin-top:16px;}
  .faq-a p{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:14.5px;
    line-height:1.75;
    max-width:680px;
    padding-left:30px;
  }

  /* ===== FINAL CTA ===== */
  .final-cta{
    text-align:center;
    padding:140px 0 100px;
  }
  .final-cta h2{
    font-family:var(--font-display);
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:clamp(30px,4.5vw,52px);
    margin-bottom:36px;
    line-height:1.15;
  }
  .final-cta h2 em{color:var(--amber);font-style:normal;}
  .final-actions{
    display:flex;
    gap:14px;
    justify-content:center;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }

  /* ===== FOOTER ===== */
  footer{
    border-top:1px solid var(--border);
    padding:36px 0;
  }
  .footer-inner{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:16px;
  }
  .footer-brand{
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--muted-2);
    letter-spacing:0.02em;
  }
  .footer-links{
    display:flex;
    gap:22px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:11.5px;
    color:var(--muted);
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:0.04em;
  }
  .footer-links a:hover{color:var(--ink);}
  .footer-note{
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:11px;
    color:var(--muted-2);
    text-align:center;
    margin-top:20px;
  }

  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    *{animation:none !important;transition:none !important;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="spline-bg">
  <spline-viewer url="https://prod.spline.design/7U0z-lNnph5WeZA0/scene.splinecode"></spline-viewer>
</div>
<div id="bg-veil"></div>
<div id="grid-overlay"></div>

<header>
  <nav>
    <div class="brand"><span class="brand-dot"></span>VEX</div>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#what">Система</a>
      <a href="#modes">Режимы</a>
      <a href="#memory">Память</a>
      <a href="#token">$VEX</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
    </div>
    <div class="nav-cta">
      <a href="#token" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">$VEX</a>
      <a href="#download" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Скачать</a>
    </div>
  </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hud-corner tl"></div>
  <div class="hud-corner tr"></div>
  <div class="hud-corner bl"></div>
  <div class="hud-corner br"></div>

  <div class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span>$VEX LIVE · ROBINHOOD CHAIN · VIA VIRTUALS</div>

  <h1>Хватит нянчиться с каждой сделкой.<br><span class="accent">Шлюз безопасности не уходит на перерыв.</span></h1>

  <p class="hero-sub">Торговый рантайм, который живёт на вашей машине. Режим «миссии» работает без присмотра сутками — но каждый своп и мост проходят один и тот же fail-closed шлюз, всегда.</p>

  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a href="#download" class="btn btn-primary">Скачать для macOS / Linux</a>
    <a href="#token" class="btn btn-ghost">Купить $VEX ↗</a>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-meta">
    <a href="#">Свободный и open source ↗</a>
